            "review_text": "Chibi Tamy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nMemorable Dinner Near Landmark 81\nAug 2026 • Family\nLocation: Great location for dinner after visiting Landmark 81 or Vinhomes Central Park.\nAtmosphere: Busy but enjoyable, with a warm Chinese-style setting.\nFood: Plenty of choices, from grilled beef and lamb to seafood, tofu, vegetables, and spicy dishes.\nService: Friendly and easygoing.\nValue: A good option for sharing food with friends or family.\nWait time: Reasonable, though evenings can be busier.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 12, 2026\n81东北原味烧烤 | BBQ kiểu Đông Bắc Trung Quốc\nThank you so much for your thoughtful review! We’re glad you enjoyed the convenient location, warm atmosphere, variety of dishes, and friendly service. It’s great to hear that the experience felt worthwhile for sharing with friends or family. We look forward to welcoming you back again!\nRead more\nWritten August 20, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
